  <title>Privacy Policy - ARE rclone backup</title>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p>Last updated: November 7, 2026</p>

  <h2>About this application</h2>
  <p>
    ARE rclone backup is a personal backup configuration
    using Restic and Rclone to store encrypted backups
    in the user's Google Drive account.
  </p>

  <h2>Google Drive permissions</h2>
  <p>
    The application requests the Google Drive
    drive.file permission to create and manage
    files accessible to the application.
  </p>

  <h2>Data processing</h2>
  <p>
    Backup contents are encrypted locally by Restic
    before being transferred to Google Drive.
    OAuth credentials are stored locally and are
    not published on this website.
  </p>

  <h2>Data sharing and retention</h2>
  <p>
    This personal backup configuration does not
    intentionally share backup contents with
    third parties. Backup retention is controlled
    by the user.
  </p>

  <h2>User control</h2>
  <p>
    The user can revoke Google Drive access through
    their Google Account settings and manage or
    delete backup files in Google Drive.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    For privacy questions, use the support email
    listed on the application's Google OAuth
    consent screen.
  </p>

  <p><a href="index.html">Back to home</a></p>
</body>
</html>
